From c8b60c27d7d389478fff658dc2f80a80f4606f2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: retropineaple <118107729+retropineaple@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 19:37:13 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 53/54] Add XE-PM CPU performance and idle profile (-wex-pm)

From JulioNectar's NootedGreen XE-PM (commit 0492b29): rescale XCPM's HWP
request on hybrid P-cores, EPP 0, energy-efficient turbo off, C8/C10 on
and C3 off in XCPM's idle table, D3hot for driverless functions, applied
20 s after boot with byte-checked routing. Adapted: -wex-pm, EPP 0 with
runtime sysctl, status in WEXPowerProfile.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
